    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwidohya kū basugi ba sī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī munhū shing'wigeleelilwe kwidohya ū kū basugi ba sī, nguno būtīho būsugi ūlū ītī mu kahelele ka ng'wa Mulungu, nū būbo būlīho nabo būtūūlilwe na Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose ūyo akūgomelaga būsugi, ū ng'wenūyo akūgūgomelaga mhayo go ng'wa Mulungu; hama abo bakagomaga bakiyenhelejaga boi benekīlī kūgwa mu nsango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno a basugi batī na lyogohya kū shītwa shawiza, alīyo kū mihayo yabūbi; ūtogilwe kūleka kūng'ogoha nsugi? Beejaga yawiza akūkūkumīlīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū wei alī ntūmami o ng'wa Mulungu kūlwa nguno yako, ū mu shītwa ī shawiza. Alīyo ūlū ūlī ng'wīti wa mihayo yabūbi, ogohaga; atadimile lūshū dalali. Ū wei ntūmami wa ng'wa Mulungu, maji wa shiilī kūlwa kūng'winha nsango ūyo alī na shītīle shabūbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, shiigelile kwidohya; ītī kūlwa nguno ya kogoha nsango dūhū, alīyo nū mu moyo mubize na wiyangūji wela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ī nguno yene mukatobaga na goodi, nguno a boi balī batūmami bakomeezu ba ng'wa Mulungu, pye a makanza bakagwītaga mu būkomeezu ū nīmo gwenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ūbinha pye a banhū īyo yigelile kūbinha; ū wa goodi goodi, ū wa mheela mheela, ūyo igelile kogohwa ng'ogohagi, nū yūyo igeleelilwe ikūjo nkūjagi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwitogwa nyadūgū",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya ū kūbiza na būgasa na munhū ose ose, ūlū ītī kwitogwa dūhū; nguno ūyo antogilwe ng'wiye, ū ng'wenūyo nshikīlīja wa shilagīlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īkī ūmo gūhayīlilwe gīkī, “Yaya ū kūshihya, Yaya ū kūbūlaga, Yaya ū kwiba, Yaya ū kwikūmva;” nūūlū shūbiza shilīho na shilagīlo shingī, pyī ī shose shikūbanījiwe mu mhayo ūyo gūhayile gīkī, “Ntogagwe nzenganwa ng'wiyo gīt'ūmo witogelilwe bebe ng'wenekīlī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būtogwa būtīko kūng'wītīla yabūbi ū nzenganwa; hū kūhaya ū būtogwa būlī būshikanu wa shilagīlo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lūshikū lo ng'wa Seeba lūlī hihī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama ūlū mulīīta ī gīko managi gīkī ī haha tūlī ng'wikanza lya kūmisha kwīnga mu tūlo, na kūbūūka; nguno ī haha ū būpīji wise būlī hihī kūtinda aho tūkandīja kūzunya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bojaga ū būjikū, būlī hihī kwangalūka, na lūūlū tūshiponyagi ī shītīle sha mu giiti twitunge shilanga sha līīmi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tūshimīzagi gīt'ūmo shiigeleelilwe mu kashimīzīle k'ikanza lya līīmi, ītī mu būlaku nūūlū būng'wi, ītī mu būjingi nūūlū kwikūmva kwabūbi, ītī mu wilemeelwa nūūlū wilu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo nzwalagi Seeba Yesu Kilisito; yaya ū kwikala ng'wiganika kwīta īyo īfumile mu kwikūmva kwa mīlī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
